<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Tim Wood</title>

  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #111;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: 60px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    h1, h2 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.2em;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-top: 2.5em;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding-bottom: 0.3em;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0.8em 0;
    }

    a {
      color: #1a73e8;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .section {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .item {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    strong {
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 60px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Tim Wood</h1>
    <p>Researcher in contemplative studies, psychology, and data analysis.</p>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <p>
        I’m a student at the Contemplative Studies Center, University of Melbourne, and currently based in the United States.
        I have experience with data analysis, coding, academic writing, and both quantitative and qualitative methods.
        I am seeking a postdoc or other research position.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Publications / Writing</h2>

      <div class="item">
        <strong>Coming soon</strong><br />
        <span>Publications will be listed here.</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:timwood82@gmail.com">timwood82@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p>ORCID: <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-7898-2876" target="_blank">0009-0003-7898-2876</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      © 2026 Tim Wood
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
